{"id":51836,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51836"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:41:45","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:41:45","slug":"sao-silvestre-de-almeirim","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-de-almeirim\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Almeirim 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Almeirim 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Almeirim 2026<\/strong> (4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se na noite de s\u00e1bado, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com tiro de partida \u00fanico \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">19:30<\/strong> na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Avenida 25 de Abril<\/strong> e chegada na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pista Municipal de Atletismo de Almeirim<\/strong>. O evento integra a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Corrida Principal de 10 km<\/strong> (10.000 metros exatos com circuito homologado pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">World Athletics<\/strong>, limitado a 600 atletas) e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini \/ Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de car\u00e1ter n\u00e3o competitivo (limitada a 500 participantes e gratuita para menores de 10 anos).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Ao correres em <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Almeirim<\/strong>, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o da lez\u00edria do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ribatejo<\/strong> (distrito de Santar\u00e9m), desfrutas de um tra\u00e7ado urbano r\u00e1pido e plano que percorre duas voltas pelas principais art\u00e9rias da cidade \u2014 passando pelo Parque das Laranjeiras, Largo dos Combatentes da Grande Guerra, Avenida D. Jo\u00e3o I, Avenida da Liberdade e Estrada da Barreira Branca \u2014 antes de cortar a meta na pista municipal (tempo limite de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">1h45<\/strong>, com fecho do controlo \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">21:15<\/strong>).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela hist\u00f3rica <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o 20 Kms de Almeirim<\/strong>, a prova alia a excel\u00eancia competitiva \u00e0 genu\u00edna hospitalidade ribatejana: todos os inscritos recebem *t-shirt* t\u00e9cnica, medalha *finisher* da 4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o, voucher para uma garrafa de vinho <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">3 Castas Fi\u00faza & Bright<\/strong> (+15% de desconto em loja), sumo, fruta na meta e, no interior do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pavilh\u00e3o Alfredo Bento Calado<\/strong>, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">1 sandes de porco assado no espeto e 1 bebida<\/strong> (copo de vinho Fi\u00faza, imperial, sumo ou \u00e1gua) ao som de anima\u00e7\u00e3o musical. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 19:30<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywh